      "uid": "zhcn:24658d49fe791281034b7c31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧并不知道这个消息。\n而她不只干劲十足，实力也变得相当坚强！\n下次终于就是“天皇赏（春）”了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c2859c1d6a9cdfe0e98262c5a216da79b1ca61611700d79bb6cc27f8c638988",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
